# blocked-patterns — one extended-regex pattern per line (grep -E syntax)
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Copy this file to .githooks/blocked-patterns and add your own patterns.
# That file is gitignored and will never be pushed to GitHub.
#
# Examples:
#   Jane Doe
#   john\.doe
#   mycompany\.com
#   MyCompany
#   my_handle
